  (null, null, 'wa-ma-9', 'salt', 'note', 'Salmon (Entire Area, MA9 Admiralty Inlet): July 16-July 18: Chinook - min. size 22 in. Other salmon species - no min. size. Daily limit 2 including no more than 1 Chinook. Release chum, wild coho, and wild Chinook. July 19-July 31: CLOSED. Aug. 1-Sept. 18: no min. size, daily limit 2, release Chinook, chum, and wild coho. Sept. 19-Sept. 30: no min. size, daily limit 2, release Chinook and chum. (Edmonds Pier and Northern Hood Canal run separate tables; Admiralty Head Marine Preserve and Keystone Conservation Area: year-round CLOSED.)', 'https://www.eregulations.com/washington/fishing/marine-area-9', 'WDFW — 2026-2027 Washington Sport Fishing Rules (Marine Area 9)', '2026-06-18', '2026-09-02', 3,
